       "text": "ANGLE ID: FB2-W48-17\nSTATUS: Copy complete\nCORE ARGUMENT: Sellers who stay listed through Thanksgiving and December need a plan for showings, access and presentation while life gets busy.\nAUDIENCE: Currently listed sellers; owners listing in December\nTAKEAWAY: Keep showings easy, keep the house warm and lit, keep decorations modest, and plan for who handles access while you travel.\nFORMAT: Text post + seasonal photo · Effort: Low\nSOURCES:\n• Evergreen. Not the 'December vs spring' timing question (covered in last week's YT2)."
